# Cozy Pi 5 — MCP2515 SocketCAN (can0)
#
# Do NOT enable until the kernel probe succeeds (see doco/mgl_can_install.md).
# A failed probe delays boot (~1s) and still leaves can0 missing.
#
# mcp2515-can0 = SPI0 CE0 (GPIO8 / pin 24), INT GPIO25 (pin 22), 5 V VCC
# See doco/mgl_can_install.md for the harness colour table.
# Do not use GPIO4 (sc16is752), GPIO14/15 (GPS UART), GPIO2/3 (AHRS I2C).

dtparam=spi=on
# Live aircraft harness (probe succeeded with SPI 500 kHz):
dtoverlay=mcp2515-can0,oscillator=8000000,interrupt=25,spimaxfrequency=500000
